msgstr "중재된 다중 미스(multiple misses)로 인해 UTCL1이 완전히 정지합니다."

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:424
msgid "TCP_UTCL1_LFIFO_FULL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:425
