msgstr "TCP_UTCL1_STALL_UTCL2_REQ_크레딧 부족"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:431
msgid "Total UTCL1 stalls due to UTCL2_req being out of credits."
